This project is an independent Rust implementation for Rockchip media hardware.
Its register layouts, bitstream behavior and validation methodology are informed
by Rockchip MPP and related Rockchip/Linux open-source interfaces.

Rockchip MPP is distributed under the Apache License 2.0. This repository does
not include Rockchip binaries, proprietary firmware or an official MPP source
checkout in the public package. Benchmarks and conformance work use separately
installed vendor/reference tooling on the test boards.

Generated tables and constants retain the attribution and compatibility notes in
their source modules. See `docs/DIVERGENCES.md` for known reference differences.
